            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Robert Kahn</strong><br>\nRobert Kahn was born on December 23, 1938, in New York City. He grew up in a period of rapid technological development, which sparked his interest in electrical engineering. Kahn attended the prestigious City College of New York, where he obtained a bachelor's degree in electrical engineering. He furthered his studies at Princeton University, earning a master's degree and later a Ph.D. in electrical engineering. His education laid the groundwork for his future contributions to computer networking.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Beginning of Kahn's Career</strong><br>\nAfter completing his education, Robert Kahn took a job at Bell Labs, a hub for many significant scientific advancements. At Bell Labs, he worked on telecommunications networks and helped to develop the groundbreaking technology of the time. Later, he joined the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) as an assistant professor. His work at MIT and Bell Labs allowed him to gain valuable experience in networking technologies.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Contribution to ARPANET</strong><br>\nKahn's notable contributions to technology began with his involvement in the ARPANET project while working at the Information Processing Techniques Office (IPTO) at the Defense Advanced Research Projects Agency (DARPA). ARPANET was the predecessor to the modern internet. Kahn was instrumental in designing and implementing new networking protocols that would allow for efficient, error-free transmission of information across the network.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
